cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "macro_candi: quantitative analysis of Candida-macrophage lattice light-sheet timelapses"
abstract: >-
  A Python/SLURM image-analysis pipeline for live 3D lattice light-sheet imaging of
  Candida-macrophage host-pathogen interaction. Converts Zeiss CZI acquisitions to
  OME-Zarr, performs 3D Cellpose-SAM segmentation of macrophages and Candida, quantifies
  engulfment/entrapment via 3D containment, and measures hyphal network growth from
  skeleton graphs with per-object tracking.
authors:
  - family-names: Kriel
    given-names: Jurgen
    email: krielj@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/JurgenKriel/macro_candi"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-26"
keywords:
  - lattice light-sheet microscopy
  - Candida albicans
  - macrophage
  - phagocytosis
  - image segmentation
  - hyphal growth
